Task 1: Set Up Request Timeouts for Services
Subtask 1.1: Deploy Sample Microservices
First, we'll deploy a set of sample microservices that will demonstrate timeout and retry behaviors.

Create a namespace for our lab:
kubectl create namespace resilient-services
kubectl label namespace resilient-services istio-injection=enabled
Create the frontend service deployment:
cat << 'EOF' > frontend-service.yaml
