Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Timeouts Not Working
Problem: Requests are not timing out as expected.

Solution:

# Check if VirtualService is applied correctly
kubectl get virtualservice -n resilient-services -o yaml

# Verify Istio sidecar injection
kubectl get pods -n resilient-services -o jsonpath='{.items[*].spec.containers[*].name}'
Issue 2: Retries Not Triggering
Problem: Retry mechanism is not working.

Solution:

# Check VirtualService retry configuration
kubectl describe virtualservice failure-simulator-retry -n resilient-services

# Verify service endpoints
kubectl get endpoints -n resilient-services
Issue 3: Circuit Breaker Not Activating
Problem: Circuit breaker is not ejecting failing instances.

Solution:

# Check DestinationRule configuration
kubectl describe destinationrule failure-simulator-circuit-breaker -n resilient-services

# Monitor Envoy admin interface for circuit breaker stats
kubectl exec -n resilient-services deployment/failure-simulator -c istio-proxy -- curl localhost:15000/stats | grep outlier
